cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  Please cite the archived pyhotpants version used in your research when a DOI
  becomes available, and credit the original HOTPANTS implementation separately.
type: software
title: "pyhotpants: Python interface to HOTPANTS image subtraction"
version: 0.3.0rc1
authors:
  - family-names: Shukawa
    given-names: Koji
repository-code: "https://github.com/zoutei/pyhotpants"
url: "https://github.com/zoutei/pyhotpants"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Python interface to Andrew Becker's HOTPANTS image-subtraction implementation,
  with inspectable fitting stages, reusable kernel solutions, and an optional
  Python/Numba backend supporting oversampled templates and connected-region
  stamps. This metadata describes an unreleased audit candidate.
keywords:
  - astronomy
  - image subtraction
  - point spread function
